PARTNERSHIP PAIRINGS
Members operate in fixed two-man cells assigned by the Leader. Partners are chosen
to balance and to watch one another. Do not trust; cooperate.

- Pain (Nagato) & Konan --- home village command, Rain.
- Itachi Uchiha & Kisame Hoshigaki --- the "unstoppable pair," intel and capture.
- Sasori & Deidara --- until Sasori's death; friction expected, results demanded.
- Tobi & Deidara --- Tobi replaces Sasori as Deidara's partner.
- Hidan & Kakuzu --- the "Zombie Combo"; both effectively immortal, bounty duty.
- Zetsu --- operates alone as scout/reconnaissance; no fixed partner.
- Orochimaru (former) & Sasori --- dissolved on Orochimaru's defection.

Reassignments are issued by the Leader only. No member reselects a partner.
